          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/awinter1.webp"),
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _Guided by Urza Afalas, Deoran and his company marched northwards, back across the Black River. The ominous gloom of the forest seemed to lift behind them as the tired soldiers returned towards the land of men. But even as the dark magic faded into memory, a new threat made itself known in the form of subtle footfalls amongst the trees...</span>"),
          },
        ],
