            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Then the Aethenwood has attacked you as well? I had hoped this hamlet would serve a safe haven, but you will find myself and my men at the ready if we are needed to defend Southport."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Defend Southport? No— ...well, you’ll see soon enough. Sir, you should get back to Westin right away."),
